
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#F8F5F0">
<meta name="description" content="Saint Leo Medical Clinic — physician-led skin health, medical aesthetics and wellness in Barbados.">
<title>Saint Leo Medical Clinic | Barbados</title>

<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500;600&family=Playfair+Display:wght@400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

<style>
:root {
  --ink: #514D47;
  --ivory: #F8F5F0;
  --taupe: #C8BEB5;
  --sage: #A7B2A0;
  --muted: #81786F;
}

* { box-sizing: border-box; }

html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }

body {
  margin: 0;
  background: var(--ivory);
  color: var(--ink);
  font-family: "DM Sans", sans-serif;
  font-size: 14px;
  line-height: 1.7;
}

a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }

.announcement {
  background: var(--ink);
  color: var(--ivory);
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  padding: 8px 7%;
  font-size: 9px;
  letter-spacing: 1px;
  text-transform: uppercase;
}

header {
  min-height: 86px;
  padding: 16px 7%;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: 24px;
}

.logo {
  font-family: "Playfair Display", serif;
  font-size: 27px;
  line-height: 1.1;
  white-space: nowrap;
}

.logo small {
  display: block;
  text-align: center;
  font-family: "DM Sans", sans-serif;
  font-size: 9px;
  letter-spacing: 4px;
  margin-top: 5px;
}

nav {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 26px;
  font-size: 10px;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: .5px;
}

.nav-cta, .outline-button {
  display: inline-block;
  border: 1px solid var(--ink);
  padding: 12px 17px;
  font-size: 10px;
  letter-spacing: .5px;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  text-align: center;
}

.hero {
  min-height: 480px;
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
  background: #E9E4DC;
  overflow: hidden;
}

.hero-copy {
  align-self: center;
  padding: 65px 12%;
}

.eyebrow {
  color: var(--muted);
  font-size: 10px;
  letter-spacing: 2px;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  margin-bottom: 18px;
}

h1, h2, h3 {
  font-family: "Playfair Display", Georgia, serif;
  font-weight: 400;
  line-height: 1.2;
}

h1 {
  font-size: clamp(38px, 5vw, 62px);
  margin: 0 0 20px;
}

h2 { font-size: clamp(32px, 4vw, 46px); margin: 0 0 20px; }

p { margin: 0 0 22px; }

.hero-image {
  min-height: 480px;
  background:
    linear-gradient(0deg, #514D4708, #514D4708),
    url("https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1616683693504-3ea7e9ad6fec?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=85")
    center 35% / cover no-repeat;
}

.section {
  padding: 95px 9%;
}

.split {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 10%;
}

.interior-image {
  min-height: 340px;
  background:
    url("https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1600210492486-724fe5c67fb0?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1000&q=85")
    center / cover no-repeat;
}

.split-copy { max-width: 470px; }

.services {
  background: #EAE4DB;
  text-align: center;
}

.services-intro {
  max-width: 560px;
  margin: 0 auto 45px;
}

.service-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
  gap: 22px;
  text-align: left;
}

.service {
  padding: 30px 25px;
  background: var(--ivory);
}

.service .number {
  font-size: 10px;
  letter-spacing: 2px;
  color: var(--muted);
}

.service h3 {
  font-size: 25px;
  margin: 25px 0 15px;
}

.appointment {
  background: var(--sage);
  text-align: center;
}

.appointment p {
  max-width: 500px;
  margin: 0 auto 25px;
}

footer {
  background: var(--ink);
  color: var(--ivory);
  padding: 45px 8%;
  text-align: center;
}

footer .logo { margin-bottom: 20px; }

footer p { font-size: 12px; }

footer a { text-decoration: underline; }

@media (max-width: 760px) {
  .announcement {
    justify-content: center;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .announcement span:last-child { display: none; }

  header {
    flex-direction: column;
    padding: 22px 5%;
  }

  nav {
    justify-content: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 14px 19px;
  }

  .nav-cta { padding: 9px 12px; }

  .hero { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }

  .hero-copy { padding: 55px 8%; }

  .hero-image {
    min-height: 360px;
    grid-row: 1;
  }

  .section { padding: 65px 7%; }

  .split { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 35px; }

  .interior-image { min-height: 280px; }

  .service-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
}
</style>
</head>

<body>
<div class="announcement">
  <span>Saint Leo Medical Clinic · Barbados</span>
  <span>Appointments by arrangement</span>
</div>

<header>
  <a href="#home" class="logo">
    SAINT LEO
    <small>MEDICAL CLINIC</small>
  </a>

  <nav aria-label="Main navigation">
    <a href="#philosophy">Our philosophy</a>
    <a href="#services">Services</a>
    <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
    <a href="#contact" class="nav-cta">Book consultation</a>
  </nav>
</header>

<main>
  <section class="hero" id="home">
    <div class="hero-copy">
      <p class="eyebrow">Skin health · Aesthetics · Wellness</p>
      <h1>The art of feeling your best.</h1>
      <p>
        A considered approach to skin health, medical
        aesthetics and wellness, centred around you.
      </p>
      <a href="#contact" class="outline-button">
        Book a consultation
      </a>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-image" role="img"
      aria-label="Beauty editorial portrait"></div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" id="philosophy">
    <div class="split">
      <div class="interior-image" role="img"
        aria-label="Elegant, neutral interior"></div>

      <div class="split-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow">Our philosophy</p>
        <h2>Care, thoughtfully considered.</h2>
        <p>
          At Saint Leo, we believe that great care begins
          with listening. Our approach places your individual
          needs, informed decisions and personal wellbeing
          at the centre of every consultation.
        </p>
        <a href="#services" class="outline-button">
          Discover our services
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section services" id="services">
    <p class="eyebrow">The Saint Leo experience</p>
    <h2>Explore our services.</h2>
    <p class="services-intro">
      Personalised care across skin health, aesthetics
      and wellness.
    </p>

    <div class="service-grid">
      <article class="service">
        <span class="number">01 — SKIN</span>
        <h3>Dermatology for Skin Health</h3>
        <p>
          Individual consultations focused on skin concerns
          and appropriate assessment and care.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="service">
        <span class="number">02 — AESTHETICS</span>
        <h3>Medical Aesthetics</h3>
        <p>
          Personalised aesthetic consultations and
          suitable treatments tailored to individual needs.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="service">
        <span class="number">03 — WELLBEING</span>
        <h3>Wellness</h3>
        <p>
          Thoughtful consultations centred on your
          wellness goals and individual needs.
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" id="about">
    <div class="split">
      <div class="split-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow">Meet your doctor</p>
        <h2>Dr. Calista Barrow</h2>
        <p>
          Discover the medical training, verified
          qualifications and professional approach
          behind Saint Leo Medical Clinic.
        </p>
        <a href="#contact" class="outline-button">
          Get in touch
        </a>
      </div>
      <div class="interior-image" role="img"
        aria-label="Calm and elegant clinic setting"></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section appointment" id="contact">
    <p class="eyebrow">Your Saint Leo experience</p>
    <h2>Begin with a conversation.</h2>
    <p>
      Contact us to enquire about our services
      and appointment availability.
    </p>
    <a class="outline-button"
       href="mailto:info@saintleoclinic.com">
      Enquire about an appointment
    </a>
  </section>
</main>

<footer>
  <div class="logo">
    SAINT LEO
    <small>MEDICAL CLINIC</small>
  </div>
  <p>Barbados</p>
  <p>
    <a href="mailto:info@saintleoclinic.com">
      info@saintleoclinic.com
    </a>
  </p>
  <p>+1 (246) 231-3556</p>
  <p>
    <a href="https://www.instagram.com/saintleoclinic/">
      Instagram · @saintleoclinic
    </a>
  </p>
  <p>© <span id="year"></span> Saint Leo Medical Clinic</p>
</footer>

<script>
  document.getElementById("year").textContent =
    new Date().getFullYear();
</script>
</body>
</html>
